* @title Gimpel BCD to EBCDIC character conversion
* @attribution James F. Gimpel, Algorithms in SNOBOL4, BCD_EBCD.SNO; Catspaw SNOBOL4+ program diskette
* @input >>>
* #@%<&
* ABC#@
* <<<
* @expect >>>
* ='()+
* ABC='
* <<<
* BCD_EBCD - one-line program to convert BCD input to EBCDIC.
*
L	OUTPUT = REPLACE(INPUT, "#@%<&", "='()+")   :S(L)
END
